# CHANGES APPLIED
#   #13  sh:closed true -> false on 10 node shapes
#   #22  removed sh:maxCount 1 from 4 partOfRun property shapes
#   #14  added partOfRun to 7 shapes: RawPlatformProfileShape, RawOrganizationProfileShape, RawMembershipShape, CollectionShape, CommunityShape, FundingShape, ExternalIdentifierShape
